{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmfLKetPaj8bFjzDJbTt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll stop here. That's six screens on a black background, and my eyes hurt.\n\n**What I'd tell my son:**\n\"Listen, I found out what this keren hishtalmut is. It's savings out of the salary. The employer puts in up to 7.5% and I put in 2.5%. The big thing is that after 6 years I can take it all out with no tax. The page said 'כשעוברות 6 שנים'. I can take it out earlier, but that's expensive: tax is taken off, and I saw '47%' in the orange box. So yes, I think it's worth having, because the employer is adding money on top of my salary. That part I'm fairly sure of. But one sentence worried me: 'השווי עולה ויורד', and also 'אין ערבות של המדינה'. So it isn't like my deposit. I'll ask you, or the bank, which track to pick. I saw a button 'אג\"ח ממשלתית' and that sounds safe to me. There was also a line in small pale grey that said something like 'for someone who reached retirement age it's only 3 years'. That matters at my age, but I'm not sure I read it right.\"\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. The top: \"חיסכון שהמעסיק ואתם מפקידים... אחרי 6 שנים... בפטור ממס\". This was clear and good.\n2. \"למה משתמשים בזה\": \"כמעט תמיד הצעד הראשון\", with employer money. Fine.\n3. \"מה מייחד\": it opened with \"S&P 500\" and a slider. I didn't touch the slider.\n4. Next came a table full of numbers. In the middle there was \"−342.02 ₪\", with a minus, and I backed away from it. The first number that stuck with me was \"415.84 ₪ יותר\".\n5. \"כסף נכנס ויוצא\": \"כשעוברות 6 שנים\", and the money arrives in \"עד 4 ימי עסקים\". Clear.\n6. \"כמה זה עולה\": \"עד 2% בשנה\" management fee, and no fee for taking the money out. 2% a year sounds like a lot to me.\n7. \"מיסוי\": the orange box about the expensive early withdrawal, then \"סיכונים\". After that I stopped.\n\n**What I skipped:** the chips \"S&P 500\", \"תמולים ואישית לפיצויים\" and \"קרן חדשה מקיפה\". I also skipped the codes \"TXH-09\", \"PF-18\" and \"KH-15\", the \"הצגת החברות\" fold, and everything from \"מה האתר לקח בחשבון\" down.\n\n**What I didn't understand:** \"S&P 500\", \"מסלול כללי\", \"ריאלי\", \"מדד\" in their sense, the codes like \"PF-06\", \"123 מקור / חושב / הזנה\", \"Pay Financial Technologies\", \"תשואה ריאלית 7%\" and \"הפקדה מוטבת\".\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The whole page is black with pale grey text, and the small grey lines were very hard to read.\n- Screen 3 has too many numbers, and there's a minus sign among them.\n- There's a company called \"פייר פיננשיאל טכנולוג'יז\" that I never heard of, so I don't know who's behind this site."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3802,"cache_read_input_tokens":11600,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3802},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54b86b8a-3e47-4459-b5a9-966de68adac1","uuid":"e331390a-1cfc-4f04-9294-6f2d74e77dcb","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:18:56.361Z","request_id":"req_011CgmfLKQFaFFCj2HVzPg1Z"}
